# Unnamed Instagram trainer

When the profile, a pinned caption, Threads, and the operator note give no given name, the given name is the Instagram handle. The surname stays empty. Do not leave `firstName` empty. Do not invent a Cyrillic name from the handle.

«Без имени» means the operator has no name. It is not the given name and not the surname.

`save-draft.ts` writes the handle into `firstName` when both name fields are empty and the note does not name a person. The live import rejects a draft with an empty given name, so this is what lets that card onto the server. The row stays a draft.

```ts
// wrong: the page has no name, so the field stays empty
firstName: "";

// right: the account is the name
firstName: "potapooff20";
lastName: "";
```
